# Worktrees

Cursor's /worktree command defaults to ~/.cursor/worktrees/<id>/. Do not use
that path. Put every checkout under this repository so Agent sandbox writes
do not need extra filesystem permission.

## Layout

- This repo: .cursor/worktrees/<epic-story-slug> (example: .cursor/worktrees/05-01-show-latest-outcome)
- One worktree per git root per chat unless the user asks for another
- Still look up .cursor/worktrees.json in the git root and in the new worktree after git worktree add, and run setup if present
- Do not switch the user's main working tree unless they ask

.cursor/worktrees/ is local (git exclude). Do not commit checkouts.
